 data-state="closed" data-slot="popover-trigger"><!-- -1 children --></button></div></div></div><div class="flatplan_body" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_body"><div><figure class="my-4 flex flex-col"><img alt="109th Running Of The Indianapolis 500" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_mainMedia" loading="lazy" width="320" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shadow-md rounded-lg object-contain h-auto w-full flatplan_mainMedia" style="color:transparent" src="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/indy-500-051626?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1600&quality=60"><figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm leading-tight"><!-- -2 children --></figcaption></figure><p><br></p><p>The first round of qualifying for the 110th Indianapolis 500 was rained out Saturday, leading to a busy, condensed schedule on Sunday.</p><p>Storms and showers rained out practice on Saturday morning and kept coming into the afternoon, forcing IndyCar to push all qualifying to Sunday.</p><div class="flex items-center">
